sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Metrics target
    participant P as Prometheus
    participant S as Time-series storage
    participant G as Grafana
    P->>T: Scrape metrics endpoint
    T-->>P: Metric names, labels, samples
    P->>S: Store timestamped samples
    G->>P: PromQL query
    P-->>G: Query result
    G-->>G: Render panel/dashboard
